    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「まるであたしみたいにちいさくなっちゃったんだね～、そろそろ寿命かな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「替えの鉛筆も持ってきたはずなんだけど、ポケットから落としちゃったみたいだし、そろそろ潮時かな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ええっと、来た道を戻らないとね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あっれ～、おかしいな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「スケッチしながらいろいろ歩いてたら、なんだか変なとこに迷い込んじゃったみたいだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どこだろ、ここ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「集中してたからあまり意識しなかったけど、あたしもけっこう寒くなってきたし、早く出て行かないとなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どうやったら元いたとこに戻れるんだろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たしか、開けっ放しのドアをくぐってきたんだよね。そこからなんか別の空間になっちゃったっていうか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ここってもしかして、非常通路とかバックヤードみたいな、スタッフ用の空間なのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「雪像とかも見当たらないし……たしか描いたスケッチのなかにも、ドアを描いたものがあったはずだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「そこから位置を思い出して、と……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「おぉ、さっそくドアを発見～♪　ここから出たらすぐに戻れそうだね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あんまり悠木くんを待たせるのも悪いし、この扉を開けて外に出ないとね～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「せーのっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ふぬぬぬぬ……あれっ、おかしいな？　ぜんぜん、開かないんだけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたしの力だと、この扉が重くて開かないのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-coat2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat2_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「も、もう一回……！」"
